    <string name="tips_title">Placing the phone</string>
    <string name="tip_selector">Set the selector to the NFC / Smart Touch position before holding the phone on the machine.</string>
    <string name="tip_chip">The phone\'s NFC chip is on the back, often near the top. Centre it on the machine\'s logo.</string>
    <string name="tip_still">Keep the phone still until it confirms, about 3 seconds. A thick or metal case can get in the way.</string>
    <string name="tip_read_first">If nothing happens, try “Read the machine” in the Machine tab first. It starts nothing and shows whether the phone and the machine can talk.</string>
    <string name="help_search_hint">Code shown, e.g. E03</string>
    <string name="onboarding_text">Start your Candy washes by holding the phone on the machine. First, let\'s check that they can talk, without starting anything.</string>
