    <string name="tip_door_closed">Make sure the door is fully closed and no clothing is caught in it.</string>
    <string name="tip_door_light">Close the door and press Start again. After a few seconds, the door lock light should stay on without flashing.</string>
    <string name="tip_tap_open">Check that the water tap is open and that there is water pressure.</string>
    <string name="tip_inlet_hose">Check that the inlet hose at the back is not kinked or crushed.</string>
    <string name="tip_inlet_filter">Close the tap, unscrew the inlet hose and clean the small filter at its end. Screw it back on and check that it does not leak.</string>
    <string name="tip_drain_height">Check that the drain hose hangs at the height given in the manual. If it is too low, the machine empties while it fills.</string>
    <string name="tip_drain_filter">Clean the drain filter behind the small flap at the bottom front. Coins, pins and bra wires often block it.</string>
    <string name="tip_drain_hose">Check that the drain hose is not kinked or crushed.</string>
    <string name="tip_wall_drain">Put the end of the drain hose in a sink and run a drain cycle. If the water flows freely, the wall drain is blocked.</string>
    <string name="tip_foam">Too much detergent, or a detergent that foams a lot, can cause this. Run one or two rinse cycles to clear the foam.</string>
    <string name="tip_keeps_filling">If the machine keeps filling, close the tap and turn the selector to OFF.</string>
    <string name="tip_hot_wash">Turn the machine off and on again, then run a wash at a high temperature.</string>
    <string name="tip_rebalance">Turn the selector to OFF and wait for the door to unlock. Spread the laundry differently, then run a spin cycle.</string>
    <string name="tip_wait_unlock">Turn the selector to OFF and wait a few minutes. The door should unlock.</string>
    <string name="tip_stuck_item">Turn the selector to OFF, wait for the door to unlock and check that nothing is stuck between the drum and the tub.</string>
    <string name="tip_spread_restart">Spread the laundry differently and start the wash again.</string>
    <string name="tip_restart_wash">Start the wash again.</string>
    <string name="tip_restart_dry">Start another drying cycle.</string>
    <string name="fault_call_service">If the code comes back, contact Candy after-sales service and give them the code.</string>
